-- THE ARGUMENT, FROM THE ENROLLED TEXT AND AGAINST THE PUBLISHED CHIP
--   Primary: the 21st Century ROAD to Housing Act is a housing act, and housing
--   affordability is its own subject rather than a title inside a vehicle. `housing`'s
--   published chip is 'Make housing more affordable by boosting supply and lowering the
--   cost to build and buy', and the enrolled text carries all three of those limbs as
