--   1715e(b)(2) roughly fourfold and re-indexes them to the Census Bureau's Price
--   Deflator Index of Multifamily Residential Units Under Construction; and the cost to
--   buy in Title IV (Accessing the American Dream) — Sec. 401 small-dollar loan
--   originator incentives, Sec. 402 small-dollar mortgage points and fees, Sec. 403
--   Appraisal Industry Improvement Act, Sec. 404 Helping More Families Save Act — in
--   Title IX (Strengthening Community Banks' Role in Housing) and in Title X
--   (Home-Ownership for Main Street America), whose single section restricts large
--   institutional-investor purchases of single-family homes. Eleven of the Act's twelve
--   titles are housing titles. Weighted 80 rather than 100 and ranked below the
--   housing_build primary because supply is the limb the Act's own long title names; the
--   weight is what ranks the two axes, not the flag.
--
-- THE COUSIN WALL
--   housing is NOT housing_build and NOT housing_support, and the promote is what makes
--   the distinction visible rather than what blurs it. housing_build's chip is 'Loosen
